  @post Combined message may be emitted to UI and/or report depending on flags.

  @sideeffects Produces user-visible/report-visible output via ui_print_helper.

  @header
  ui_print_str_4(Str1: string; Str2: string; Str3: string; Str4: string; Report: boolean = FALSE; Warning: boolean = FALSE; Error: boolean = FALSE; Debug: boolean = FALSE): void;
  Concatenate four strings then print via helper.
*}
function ui_print_str_4(Str1: string; Str2: string; Str3: string; Str4: string; Report: boolean = FALSE; Warning: boolean = FALSE; Error: boolean = FALSE; Debug: boolean = FALSE): void;
begin
   // Initialize with Str1 and append Str2.
   Str = StrAdd(Str1, Str2);
   // Append Str3 to the intermediate string.
   Str = StrAdd(Str, Str3);
   // Append Str4 to the intermediate string.
   Str = StrAdd(Str, Str4);

   // Forward the combined string and flags to the printing helper.
   ui_print_helper(Str, Report, Warning, Error, Debug);
   
end;

